# Copy to deploy/.env or export in the shell before `make up` / `make cli`.
# Compose reads env from the process environment and an optional `.env` next to
# the compose file when invoked from that directory; Makefile uses repo-root cwd.

# Optional Kaggle Public API bearer (KGAT_). Prefer exporting before `make up`.
# KAGGLE_API_TOKEN=
# MYMLFW_KAGGLE_API_TOKEN=
# KAGGLE_USERNAME=
# KAGGLE_KEY=

# Host directory mounted at /work in the cli container (default: repo root).
# MYMLFW_WORK=/absolute/path/to/contest

# API base URL as seen from inside the cli container (Compose service DNS).
# MYMLFW_API=http://api:8000
